# Secretos — NUNCA commitear (credenciales de login y DSN de BD por cliente)
secrets/*.env
secrets/playas/
# (secrets/qa-credentials.env.example SÍ se trackea — es plantilla sin secretos)

# Salida temporal / logs de runtime
automation/reports/*.json
automation/reports/*.log
automation/reports/*.db
automation/db/_tmp_*.json
automation/db/_tmp_server_cache.json
automation/db/tmp_*
.playwright-mcp/

# Directorios de corridas — se generan localmente, no van al repo
automation/reports/playwright_*/
automation/reports/web_*/
automation/reports/web-extendido_*/
automation/reports/consolidado_*/

# Perfil duplicado — usar run_vzla.yaml (con guion bajo) de qa-guiones-regresion
automation/clientes/run-vzla.yaml

# Trazas record→replay (RUNTIME §12) — no commitear hasta validarlas con validateTrace
automation/reports/*/_trace/
automation/replay/traces/

.env
*.local
.claude/settings.local.json
